{"5107410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void God", "steam_appid": 5107410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107410/extras/53010b0a96e422eccf64e48c1a7294d9.avif?t=1788108768\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107410/extras_big/53010b0a96e422eccf64e48c1a7294d9.avif?t=1788108768 width=1560 height=482 /></span>Assault the Void. Destroy the guardians. Upgrade your Void Ship. Kill the Void God. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves of angry guardians will try to destroy you. And they will succeed. But death is just an opportunity to grow. Use the resources you gathered from their destruction and upgrade your weapons, abilities and Void Ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon can act as a Weapon when equipped in a weapons hardpoint. Or as an ability when equipped there. Or as a support when equipped in one of the rare support slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107410/extras/53010b0a96e422eccf64e48c1a7294d9.avif?t=1788108768\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107410/extras_big/53010b0a96e422eccf64e48c1a7294d9.avif?t=1788108768 width=1560 height=482 /></span>Assault the Void. Destroy the guardians. Upgrade your Void Ship. Kill the Void God. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves of angry guardians will try to destroy you. And they will succeed. But death is just an opportunity to grow. Use the resources you gathered from their destruction and upgrade your weapons, abilities and Void Ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon can act as a Weapon when equipped in a weapons hardpoint. Or as an ability when equipped there. Or as a support when equipped in one of the rare support slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Every weapon you pick up can act as a weapon when equipped in a weapons hardpoint. Or as an ability when equipped there. Or as a support when equipped in one of the rare support slots. Destroy the guardians as quickly as you can. Gather the rewarded weapons. Slot them in and keep shooting.  ", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107410/8e696c49dded74273e74e034a6af1d036d5e8ce9/header.jpg?t=1788108768", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107410/3d1adcdc1600af05a7c23d6046b8bed6210a516d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788108768", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107410/3d1adcdc1600af05a7c23d6046b8bed6210a516d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788108768", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260XAPI<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / A